    "text": "<p>As shown in the figure, after passing through the medium <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mn>1</mn></math>.&nbsp;The speed of light <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msub><mi>v</mi><mn>2</mn></msub></math> in medium <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mn>2</mn></math> will be :<br />(Given <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>c</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>3</mn><mo>&#215;</mo><msup><mn>10</mn><mn>8</mn></msup><mo>&#160;</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">m</mi><mo>&#160;</mo><msup><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">s</mi><mrow><mo>-</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></msup><mo>&#160;</mo></math>)</p><p><img src=\"https://cdn-question-pool.getmarks.app/pyq/jee_main/2db558d4-2c3b-4b82-a15d-b6594ae802ad-image.png\" style=\"width: 200px; height: 88px;\" /></p>",
